  <div class="hub-head"><p class="byline"><img class="byline-photo" src="/authors/akshay-golechha.webp" alt="Akshay Golechha" width="44" height="44" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="byline-text"><span class="byline-line">By <a class="byline-name" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/akshaygolechha/" rel="author noopener" target="_blank">Akshay Golechha</a><a class="byline-social" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/akshaygolechha/" rel="noopener" target="_blank" aria-label="Akshay Golechha on LinkedIn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M20.45 20.45h-3.55v-5.57c0-1.33-.03-3.04-1.85-3.04-1.86 0-2.14 1.45-2.14 2.94v5.67H9.35V9h3.41v1.56h.05c.48-.9 1.64-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.6 0 4.27 2.37 4.27 5.46v6.28zM5.34 7.43a2.06 2.06 0 1 1 0-4.12 2.06 2.06 0 0 1 0 4.12zM7.12 20.45H3.56V9h3.56v11.45z"/></svg></a></span><span class="byline-role">Chief Business Officer, Plum · Updated 14 Oct 2026</span></span></p></div>
  <section id="overview" class="overview" aria-labelledby="overview-h">
    <div style="height:48px"></div>
    <div class="intro-strip">
      <div class="intro-card"><div class="intro-card-label">Typical spend</div><div class="intro-card-value">₹6,000–24,000 per employee a year (middle half, Plum FY26)</div></div>
      <div class="intro-card"><div class="intro-card-label">Most common sum insured</div><div class="intro-card-value">₹5–7.5 lakh per family</div></div>
